<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Document</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 1.5em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5em;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 1em;
    margin-bottom: 1em;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
  }
  th {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .section-header {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 1.5em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5em;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <p>Policies and Procedures - UCM System</p>
  <p>College of Medicine and Science</p>
  <h1>Student Selection Committee Policy</h1>
  
  <div class="section-header">Scope</div>
  <p>Applies to <span data-field="scope_description">{{ scope_description }}</span> faculty and employees when staffing and administering the student selection committee for primary professional programs and residencies or fellowships.</p>

  <div class="section-header">Purpose</div>
  <p>To establish standards for the <span data-field="purpose_description">{{ purpose_description }}</span> Committee.</p>
  <p>To establish the standards used in the selection of <span data-field="purpose_description_2">{{ purpose_description_2 }}</span> students.</p>

  <div class="section-header">Policy</div>
  <ol>
    <li>MCSHS Selection Committee must include one member with an interest in diversity.</li>
    <li>MCSHS Selection Committees may include individuals who are not employees of <span data-field="policy_description_2">{{ policy_description_2 }}</span>.</li>
    <li>MCSHS Selection Committee members must view/complete the course <span data-field="policy_description_3">{{ policy_description_3 }}</span> in Admissions and Selection, Course ID <span data-field="policy_course_id">{{ policy_course_id }}</span> in My Learning.</li>
    <li>MCSHS Selection Committee members must review the weighting of the following student selection factors:
      <ul>
        <li>a. Academics (<span data-field="policy_factor_a">{{ policy_factor_a }}</span>, Test Scores)</li>
        <li>b. Life/Work/Career Experience</li>
        <li>c. Personal Statement/Letter of Interest/Letters of Reference</li>
        <li>d. Experiential/Behavioral Interviews</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Admissions offers must be made by consensus.</li>
  </ol>

  <div class="section-header">Policy Notes</div>
  <p>N/A</p>

  <div class="section-header">Related Procedures</div>
  <p><span data-field="related_procedure_link">{{ related_procedure_link }}</span> (MCSHS)</p>

  <div class="section-header">Related Documents</div>
  <p>N/A</p>

  <div class="section-header">Definitions</div>
  <p>N/A</p>

  <div class="section-header">References</div>
  <p>N/A</p>

  <div class="section-header">Owner</div>
  <p><span data-field="owner_name">{{ owner_name }}</span> on behalf of <span data-field="owner_department">{{ owner_department }}</span> Academic Affairs Committee</p>

  <div class="section-header">Contact</div>
  <p><span data-field="contact_name">{{ contact_name }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p>Policies and Procedures - UCM System</p>
  
  <div class="section-header">Revision History</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Date</th>
        <th>Description</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="revision_date_1">{{ revision_date_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="revision_description_1">{{ revision_description_1 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="revision_date_2">{{ revision_date_2 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="revision_description_2">{{ revision_description_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="revision_date_3">{{ revision_date_3 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="revision_description_3">{{ revision_description_3 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-header">Content Information</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Notification Receipt:</th>
        <th>Workflow Reviewer Name(s):</th>
        <th>Workflow Approver Name(s):</th>
        <th>Scheduled Review Due Date:</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
